        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Please beware and don’t waste your time. I had chosen her as my notary because we got accepted for a mortgage. She was completely unresponsive, and didn’t give an update whatsoever when we asked her if she could do the transaction in time. We were working with a tight deadline and an answer was more than necessary. Completely unprofessional. We ended up taking our business elsewhere. Now we have to push our closing date because we were waiting on an answer and never got one.",
        "time": 1634326833,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "James K.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106203605899731856276/reviews",
