      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marie Legault",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104380933389916021645/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCoysnulpmL8QtkT_pm24V0E_VTzgRKEbHCsWcYPSKR2HNlCT2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Ms. Gagnon is an excellent notary. She is highly competent, takes the time to get to know her clients, and demonstrates great empathy in difficult situations. She anticipates questions, answers all of them, and plans for potential problems. She is very flexible when needed, travels to clients' homes, and can work weekends when a transaction requires it.\n\nI highly recommend her.",
        "time": 1613186030,
        "translated": true
      },
